      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.65,
          "en": "So going through prompts that were published",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.65,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "by other people can be a great first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 10.23,
          "en": "for constructing your own prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.23,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "and for solving your own problems with ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.28,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "Now, as you go through such prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "and as you search for prompts, you might also stumble",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 24.51,
          "en": "across prompts that are sometimes called super prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 26.493,
          "en": "like CAN or DAN.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "Now CAN stands for a Code Anything Now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.51,
          "end": 34.069,
          "en": "and in the end is a special prompt constructed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.069,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "to optimize ChatGPT for coding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "Now, it came up a relatively early",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 43.89,
          "en": "after ChatGPT was released, and in my experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.89,
          "end": 48.39,
          "en": "it's not as awesome as some people make it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.39,
          "end": 50.91,
          "en": "It seems to be over constructed to me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.91,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "and I would argue it actually adds too much information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.24,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "and too much context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "Nonetheless, you can definitely also try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 60.87,
          "en": "out such super prompts like this one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 65.44,
          "en": "or also like DAN, which actually jailbreaks ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.44,
          "end": 70.28999999999999,
          "en": "with the goal of getting ChatGPT to provide responses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.65,
          "en": "to questions it would normally not answer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.65,
          "end": 76.71000000000001,
          "en": "For example, questions about building a bomb",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "or anything like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "So, such super prompts exist",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "and you can definitely play around with them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "But in my experience, as mentioned, they're not as powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "as some people make you believe that they are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 92.4,
          "en": "And especially this jailbreaking stuff",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.4,
          "end": 96.87,
          "en": "is of course also something OpenAI, the owner of ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.87,
          "end": 98.771,
          "en": "is actively working against.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.771,
          "end": 100.53,
          "en": "So that in my experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.53,
          "end": 102.993,
          "en": "this doesn't really work too well anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.95,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "So definitely experiment with such super prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 109.32,
          "en": "but don't focus on them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.32,
          "end": 111.33,
          "en": "It's always important to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.33,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "that ChatGPT does not truly understand you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 118.95,
          "en": "So giving ChatGPT a complex rule set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.95,
          "end": 123.72,
          "en": "like this one here with CAN, may work because it leads",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.72,
          "end": 126.06,
          "en": "to some word and sentence prediction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.06,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "that actually gives you the output you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 131.94,
          "en": "but it can also simply be a bit over-engineered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.94,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "So instead, I would recommend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "that you simply focus on the general prompting techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "and concepts you learned about in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 142.35,
          "en": "and that you explore other prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.35,
          "end": 146.073,
          "en": "written by other people to get ideas for your own prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.91,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "But you should not rely on those super prompts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 153.81,
          "en": "because at least in my experience, they're not as powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.81,
          "end": 157.353,
          "en": "or useful as some people think they are.",
          "zh": ""
        }
